---
import BaseLayout from '@shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description = 'Terms of using ConvertKDP. The short version: results are estimates; you accept the site as-is and are responsible for your own decisions.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pathname="/terms/" schemaType="WebPage">
  <article class="prose-like max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: 2026-05-08</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Use at your own risk</h2>
    <p>ConvertKDP's converters provide results based on the inputs you enter, using authoritative source data (e.g., the IANA time zone database) where applicable. They are not financial, tax, legal, medical, or scheduling advice. Always verify time-sensitive conversions (e.g., flight bookings) against the airline or operator's stated time zone, and consult a qualified professional before making consequential decisions based on a conversion.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">No warranty</h2>
    <p>The site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that the conversions are error-free or up to date with the latest IANA database revisions, currency rates, or unit definitions.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, ConvertKDP and its operators are not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the site or reliance on its outputs.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">External links and ads</h2>
    <p>Pages may contain ads (via Google AdSense) and links to third-party sites. We do not endorse or vouch for the products or content of third parties.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The site's design, code, and original written content are © ConvertKDP / Kdp.Cool. Public-domain reference data we cite (e.g., the IANA time zone database) is attributed to its source.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site means you accept the current terms.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Contact</h2>
    <p>See <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Contact</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
